omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LMO6ZfWE7xUQ7kNvwHU98cM&_nc_oc=Adrw_gQzodd5-otgnSf5UerJsP9FIbilY0iCYqxGcPUZylSziWDVKPZpgAxjyAEY1Pg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1q-KlUqXRKv6kJzeCk8H1TcxLTjYEAZ1dGVrEkavyxqw&oe=69DB8074"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jPPDEC4oPyQQ7kNvwEWiyjv&_nc_oc=Adp3vIzJHetuSea35PVeXDK26LeAZj-np-uxkTi1pQ9sGQxcmIwlh_xoxGzHF-zapJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2KoG2_cPKcmED6UufqGcEEBPNm4fZSW-50w9V46MytfQ&oe=69DB81D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KbKWhiQEsQwQ7kNvwG1RhOC&_nc_oc=AdrY6IlhO0XWTETY_U0IOjeTx9ei1v-4avnT-BfuoIzySgk4z_ECHtdpxOnwyJmv3s4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af01kTktGHfePqceSruMAN707BGkNPrBuW_snUbblwXm2A&oe=69DB96F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://